Package: tempest
Title: STORM and Co-STORM Research and Writing Agents for R
Version: 0.3.0.9000
Authors@R: c(
    person("James", "Wade", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "github@jameshwade.com"),
    person("OpenAI", role = "cph")
  )
Description: Implements an R-native clone of the STORM and Co-STORM
    research-and-writing workflows using 'ellmer' for LLM orchestration and
    'shinychat' for an interactive Shiny UI. Includes web retrieval tools,
    evidence tracking with citations, mind-map style topic planning, and
    evaluation helpers built on 'vitals'. Tempest owns provisional scientific
    research state, claim-centered evidence, authoritative STORM and Co-STORM
    product flows, and scientific reports. It delegates execution to 'deputy',
    structured research programs to 'dsprrr', and accepted-knowledge
    publication to 'graft'.
